        "impact": "Users navigating with keyboard or assistive technology cannot properly interact with [role='tablist']: Multiple tabs (7) are in the sequential Tab navigation sequence. The ARIA tabs pattern requires roving tabindex (only active tab has tabindex=0; inact",
